    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An information content entity (a data item) that documents whether, and which, therapeutic intervention  -  a medication exposure or a non-pharmacological therapy intended to prevent, manage, or treat a clinical condition  -  was administered to or planned for a patient, and that is about the corresponding intervention process."
  } ],
