    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A patient characteristic record that documents a person's habitual behaviors, exposures, or daily living patterns that may affect health (e.g., smoking, alcohol use, diet, physical activity, sleep), typically reported by the person or observed over time."
  } ],
